{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/binghatti-amberhall-binghatti-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":78,"crm_id":"4314","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Binghatti Amberhall","slug":"binghatti-amberhall-binghatti-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Binghatti","price":745000,"display_price":"745K","lattitude":25.05008,"longitude":55.2070703,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Binghatti Amberhall is the latest residential project in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/jumeirah-village-circle/\">Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)</a>, Dubai. Developed by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-binghatti/\">Binghatti</a>, this stunning project offers a collection of <strong>studios, 1 and 2-bedroom apartments</strong>—each meticulously crafted to reflect modern living. With dynamic layouts, premium materials, and serene, light-filled spaces, every residence is designed to provide both functionality and flair.</p><p>The apartments feature spacious terraces offering stunning city views, indoor and outdoor fitness zones, resort-style swimming pools for adults and children, as well as wellness-focused features like a yoga area, jogging track, and outdoor seating spaces. A dedicated kids’ play area and lush green surroundings foster a sense of community and relaxation. Binghatti Amberhall isn’t just a residence—it’s a statement of refined living in one of Dubai’s most desirable neighborhoods.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Ci