lly placed in one of Dubai’s most vibrant and peaceful neighborhoods, offering access to Circle Mall, Dubai Marina, and key highways.</li><li>Architectural Excellence: The development features a stunning façade that reflects modern sophistication and functionality, making it an architectural landmark.</li><li>Modern and Spacious Residences: Choose from studios (from 400 sq. ft.), 1-bedroom (from 726 sq. ft.), and 2-bedroom apartments (from 1200 sq. ft.) with open layouts and natural light.</li><li>World-Class Amenities: Includes a fully equipped gym, swimming pool, BBQ area, tennis courts, kids’ play zones, and more, catering to every lifestyle need.</li><li>Community-Centric Design: Designed for harmonious living, Binghatti Amberhall balances privacy with community engagement in a welcoming, secure setting.</li><li>Proximity to Shopping and Leisure: Minutes away from Circle Mall, Mall of the Emirates, Dubai Butterfly Garden, and Burj Al Arab, residents enjoy unmatched convenience.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1479,"cta":{"id":2258,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_48040a3d47.jpg","hash":"Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_48040a3d47","name":"Binghatti Amberhall at Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC) Dubai"},"style":null,"title":"Prime Location, Seamless Connectivity—Where Convenience Meets Comfort.","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Binghatti Amberhall at Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC) Dubai offers an ideal location that blends tranquility with excellent connectivity. This residential project by Binghatti Developers is strategically situated, providing easy access to key landmarks such as Downtown Dubai, Dubai Marina,