serene surroundings, and excellent connectivity to key Dubai landmarks."},"more_info":[{"id":6266,"answer":"<p>Binghatti Amberhall is a residential project by Binghatti Developers, located in Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC), Dubai. It combines modern architecture with elegant design, offering luxury living in one of Dubai’s most well-connected neighborhoods.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Binghatti Amberhall and where is it located?"},{"id":6267,"answer":"<p>The project offers a range of units including studios, 1-bedroom, and 2-bedroom apartments. These residences are designed with dynamic layouts, spacious floor plans, and premium finishes to suit both individuals and families.</p>","question":"What types of apartments are available at Binghatti Amberhall?"},{"id":6268,"answer":"<p>Studios start from 400 sq. ft.<br>1-bedroom apartments from 726 sq. ft.<br>2-bedroom apartments from 1200 sq. ft.</p>","question":"What is the starting size for units in Binghatti Amberhall?"},{"id":6269,"answer":"<p>Amenities include resort-style pools, indoor &amp; outdoor fitness zones, yoga area, jogging track, kids’ play area, landscaped gardens, outdoor seating, and community spaces—offering a complete lifestyle experience.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What amenities does Binghatti Amberhall offer?"},{"id":6270,"answer":"<p>The project offers a 70/30 payment plan—with 70% payable during construction and 30% due on handover. This makes it easier for buyers to manage payments while securing a prime residence.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the Binghatti Amberhall payment plan?"},{"id":6271,"answer":"<p>Its strategic location, competitive pricing, high rental yield potential, and luxury amenities make it an excellent choice for both end-users and investors looking for long-term value.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What makes Binghatti Amberhall a good investment opportunity?"},{"id":6272,"answer":"<p>Studios start from AED 745,000, 1-bedroom apartments from AED 1 million, and 2-bedroom apartments from AED 1.6 million. To buy, contact the expert agent at Provident Estate.</p>","question":"How can I buy a unit at Binghatti Amberhall?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"i/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_0752b6be5c.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_0752b6be5c.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/420x/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_0752b6be5c.webp","format":"webp","transform":"420x","created_at":"2025-04-10 14:47:27.496","updated_at":"2025-04-10 14:47:27.496"}]},{"src_url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_fab759856e.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_fab759856e.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_fab759856e.webp","format":"webp","transform":"744x","created_at":"2025-04-10 14:12:57.220","updated_at":"2025-04-10 15:00:08.155"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x512/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_fab759856e.webp","format":"webp","transform":"376x512","created_at":"2025-04-10 15:00:08.155","updated_at":"2025-04-10 15:00:08.155"}]},{"src_url":"i/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_ffefa8a7e5.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_ffefa8a7e5.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1300x500/Binghatti_Amberhall_at_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_Dubai_ffefa8a7e5.webp","format":"webp","transform":"1300x500","created_at":"2025-04-10 14:46:47.854","updated_at":"2025-04-10 15:00:22.374"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.e